{"config":{"lang":["fr"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"],"fields":{"title":{"boost":1000.0},"text":{"boost":1.0},"tags":{"boost":1000000.0}}},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"","text":"<p>Bienvenue sur Ouestmatique, un site de cours de math\u00e9matiques pour la MPSI.</p>"},{"location":"#cours-mpsi","title":"Cours MPSI","text":""},{"location":"#preliminaires","title":"Pr\u00e9liminaires","text":"<ul> <li>Rappels de trigonom\u00e9trie    Formulaire   </li> <li>Pr\u00e9liminaires    El\u00e9ments de logique   </li> </ul>"},{"location":"#analyse","title":"Analyse","text":"<ul> <li>Fonctions usuelles    D\u00e9rivabilit\u00e9 \u2022 Calcul d'int\u00e9grales \u2022 Fonctions trigonom\u00e9triques \u2022 Fonctions trigonom\u00e9triques r\u00e9ciproques \u2022 Fonctions hyperboliques \u2022 Fonction exponentielle \u2022 Logarithme n\u00e9p\u00e9rien \u2022 Fonctions puissances   </li> <li>EDO lin\u00e9aires    Equations lln\u00e9aires d'ordre 1 \u2022 Primitives usuelles \u2022 Equations lin\u00e9aires d'ordre 2    </li> <li>Suites    Borne sup\u00e9rieure/inf\u00e9rieure \u2022 Suites convergentes \u2022 Th\u00e9or\u00e8me de Bolzano-Weierstrass   </li> <li>Fonctions \u2014 Partie 1    Continuit\u00e9 \u2022 Limite   </li> <li>Fonctions \u2014 Partie 2     D\u00e9rivabilit\u00e9 \u2022 D\u00e9veloppements limit\u00e9s   </li> </ul>"},{"location":"#algebre","title":"Alg\u00e8bre","text":"<ul> <li>Calculs alg\u00e9briques    Sommes \u2022 Bin\u00f4me de Newton \u2022 Syst\u00e8mes lin\u00e9aires    </li> <li>Complexes    G\u00e9n\u00e9ralit\u00e9s \u2022 Racines de l'unit\u00e9 \u2022 Equations du second degr\u00e9   </li> <li>Alg\u00e8bre g\u00e9n\u00e9rale    Op\u00e9rations sur les ensembles \u2022 Fonctions injectives, surjectives, bijectives \u2022 Relations binaires    </li> <li>Arithm\u00e9tique    Divisibilit\u00e9 \u2022 PGCD \u2022 PPCM \u2022 Entiers premiers \u2022 Congruences   </li> <li>Compl\u00e9ments d\u2019alg\u00e8bre    Loi de composition interne \u2022 Groupes \u2022 Anneaux \u2022 Corps   </li> <li>Espaces vectoriels \u2014 Partie 1    Espaces vectoriels \u2022 Applications lin\u00e9aires \u2022 Familles li\u00e9es, libres    </li> <li>Polyn\u00f4mes    Degr\u00e9 \u2022 Racines \u2022 Arithm\u00e9tique des polyn\u00f4mes   </li> </ul> Me contacter <p>       Pour toute question :     </p>        Envoyer un email"},{"location":"cours/algebre_generale/","title":"Alg\u00e8bre g\u00e9n\u00e9rale","text":""},{"location":"cours/algebre_generale/#ressources","title":"Ressources","text":"<ul> <li>Consulter le cours HTML</li> <li>T\u00e9l\u00e9charger le PDF</li> </ul>"},{"location":"cours/arithmetique/","title":"Arithm\u00e9tique","text":""},{"location":"cours/arithmetique/#ressources","title":"Ressources","text":"<ul> <li>Consulter le cours HTML</li> <li>T\u00e9l\u00e9charger le PDF</li> </ul>"},{"location":"cours/calculs_algebriques/","title":"Calculs alg\u00e9briques","text":""},{"location":"cours/calculs_algebriques/#ressources","title":"Ressources","text":"<ul> <li>Consulter le cours HTML</li> <li>T\u00e9l\u00e9charger le PDF</li> </ul>"},{"location":"cours/complements_algebre/","title":"Compl\u00e9ments d\u2019alg\u00e8bre","text":""},{"location":"cours/complements_algebre/#ressources","title":"Ressources","text":"<ul> <li>Consulter le cours HTML</li> <li>T\u00e9l\u00e9charger le PDF</li> </ul>"},{"location":"cours/complexes/","title":"Complexes","text":""},{"location":"cours/complexes/#ressources","title":"Ressources","text":"<ul> <li>Consulter le cours HTML</li> <li>T\u00e9l\u00e9charger le PDF</li> </ul>"},{"location":"cours/edo_lineaires/","title":"EDO lin\u00e9aires","text":""},{"location":"cours/edo_lineaires/#ressources","title":"Ressources","text":"<ul> <li>Consulter le cours HTML</li> <li>T\u00e9l\u00e9charger le PDF</li> </ul>"},{"location":"cours/espaces_vectoriels_P1/","title":"Espaces vectoriels \u2014 Partie 1","text":""},{"location":"cours/espaces_vectoriels_P1/#ressources","titl